      "writtenOn": "2023-10-27T04:30:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With this optimization, the code in crrev.com/c/4982550 is able to capture what goes on on the I2C wires during a test of corner cases, in a format that can be loaded into off-the-shelf graphical logic analyzer programs.  This information will supplement the text logs and can greatly help engineers find out what happened during a nightly test.",
